  ultimateText: "\u0110\xE0o Vi\xEAn K\u1EBFt Ngh\u0129a: hoa \u0111\xE0o r\u01A1i
    kh\u1EAFp s\xE2n \u2014 m\u1ECDi \u0111\u1ED3ng minh h\u1ED3i 25% m\xE1u + 30%
    c\xF4ng 6s; anh em k\u1EBFt ngh\u0129a +2 mana."
  passiveText: "K\u1EBFt Ngh\u0129a: 2/3 anh em tr\xEAn s\xE2n \u2192 +10% c\xF4ng
    v\xE0 m\xE1u, \u0111\u1EE7 3/3 \u2192 th\xEAm +25% t\u1ED1c h\u1ED3i mana. Nh\xE2n
    \u0110\u1EE9c: hero quanh L\u01B0u B\u1ECB h\u1ED3i mana +15% (anh em \xD72)."
  minorText: "\xC2n \u0110\u1EE9c: \u0111\u1ED3ng minh m\u1EA5t m\xE1u nhi\u1EC1u
    nh\u1EA5t h\u1ED3i 15% m\xE1u t\u1ED1i \u0111a + gi\u1EA3i cho\xE1ng, tr\xF3i,
    ch\u1EADm."
  secondMinorText: "\u0110\u1ED3ng Sinh C\u1ED9ng T\u1EED: anh em k\u1EBFt ngh\u0129a
    ng\xE3 xu\u1ED1ng l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u m\u1ED7i wave \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\u1EA3i
    l\u1EE5a \u0111\xE0o k\xE9o d\u1EADy sau 1s v\u1EDBi 30% m\xE1u + 2s b\u1EA5t
    t\u1EED."
